   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Crowd/Greeting By Billy**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Ashland Breakdown**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Drifting With The Tide**: rare: 6 archived performances [2]\n- **Billy Banter/Thanks**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n- **@Wait A Minute**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [2]\n- **^Little Martha**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **+%Ramblin' Man**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-19** (recommended): source not stated; 33 songs; 168 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Stage talk about: Billy [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-04-19**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Tagged as show number 132 of 2024, from Team Dirty South and Home Team Recording [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N1 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n1-2024-poster-regular/) [3]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N1 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n1-2024-poster-regular/) [4]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N3 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n3-2024-poster-regular/) [5]\n- Poster by St Augustine Amphitheatre: [Billy Strings Tickets | 19 April 2024 | St. Augustine Amphitheatre](https://www.augustineamp.com/events/billy-strings-19-april-2024/) [6]\n- Fan art by Brutifulstore.com: [Billy Strings April 2024 Tour The St Augustine Amphitheatre Event Wall Art Poster Canvas](https://brutifulstore.com/product/billy-strings-april-2024-tour-the-st-augustine-amphitheatre-event-wall-art-poster-canvas/) [7]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings St. Augustine Amp N2 2024 Poster Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/st-augustine-amp-n2-2024-poster-regular/) [8]",
